{"overview":"داستان بین دوره‌های کاماکورا و موروماچی، در طول دوران اصلاحات کنمو، روایت می‌شود و داستان هوجو توکیوکی، پسری را دنبال می‌کند که پس از سرنگونی خانواده‌اش توسط آشیکاگا تاکااوجی، در حال فرار است. ارباب جوان که تنها متحدانش یک کشیش مرموز و پیروانش هستند، باید به دنبال انتقام باشد و با تنها سلاح خود، یعنی توانایی فرابشری فرار و پنهان شدن، شکوه خود را بازیابد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Set between the Kamakura and Muromachi periods, during the Kenmu Restoration, the story follows the tale of Hojo Tokiyuki, a boy on the run after his family is overthrown by Ashikaga Takauji. With his only allies being a shady priest and his followers, the young lord must seek revenge and regain his glory, with his only weapon: a superhuman ability to flee and hide.","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":1,"y":2024,"poster":""},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2024,"poster":"/8T3QsGzRvvAPUUw9Z1UjLNCQZlH.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/p0s5ymGzfM4zGQCVaU9MJOSaAWu.jpg"}],"episodes":24,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[],"trailer":"I6A5NHaXvvk","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/222623/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"buy","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/222623/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"buy","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png"}]},"CA":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/222623/watch?locale=CA","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","ki